{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And you shall not cause to sin</b> — and adjacent to it: \"When a man takes a wife.\" She saves a person from sin." "<b>Her heritage</b> — and adjacent to it: \"When a man takes.\" That is, \"House and wealth are the heritage of fathers\" (Proverbs 19:14), but \"when a man takes a wife\" — a wife is from YHWH. And further, to teach that a woman's ketubah is paid from land. And further, to teach that she was likened to heritage, to be acquired through three methods."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:10:31.877394703Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}